    "teach_2": {
      "id": "teach_2",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The minus version, once more with feeling:\n\n(a − b)^3 = a^3 − b^3 − 3ab(a − b)\n\n48^3 = (50 − 2)^3\n= 125000 − 8 − 3 × 50 × 2 × 48\n= 125000 − 8 − 14400\n= 110592",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_2_step"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_2_step": {
      "id": "teach_2_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Compare the twins:\n\n(a + b)^3: add b^3, add 3ab(a + b)\n(a − b)^3: subtract b^3, subtract 3ab(a − b)\n\nThe a^3 never changes sign. The other two pieces follow the minus.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_2"
        }
      ]
    },
