      "content": {
        "text": "Cubes also run backwards.\n\nGiven a + b = 10 and ab = 21, find a^3 + b^3.\n\nCube the sum:\n\n(a + b)^3 = 1000\na^3 + b^3 + 3ab(a + b) = 1000",
